In UX/UI Design
=================

Designers commonly create:
==========================
- low-fidelity mind maps
- grayscale node diagrams
- icon-only concept maps
- wireframe mind maps (*****)
before real content is added.

Tools commonly used:
====================
- Figma
- Abobe XD
- Sketch

Common Elements
===============
Wireframe mind maps often include:
==================================
- rectangles for screens
- arrows for navigation
- placeholders for images
- menus
- cards
- forms
- buttons
- user flows
- annotations

